  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the most recent SDK update, the new multi-platform upload process is a lot easier with only one issue that makes it useless to me. You cannot specify which model is the PC and Quest version! I like to separate my PC and Quest models as different instances and swap them through EasyQuestSwitch to be able to upload the specific avatars.\n\nSpecifying which model is for which platform would be amazing, and make the new multi-platform upload feature worth using outside of World uploads for me. If the current behaviour is preferred, you can leave the other platform models blank. A simple drag and drop for this type of thing will go a long way!\n\nThe update for me only hinders my avatar uploading experience as I have to unselect Windows and select Android every time I want to swap to the other platform and vise versa. I think that it would improve the system tenfold.",
